      "short": "$\\sqrt{25}=5$, which is rational.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{25}&=5\\\\5&=\\frac{5}{1}\\end{align*}$$Since $5$ can be written as a fraction of integers, it is rational. A square root can be rational.",
